# Project organization

**Phase focus:** control-plane foundations and capabilities (`F*` / `C*`) are largely implemented — Workflow Type/Implementation definitions, compilation, Effective Run Configuration, linked runs, operation bindings, sandbox snapshots, and schema grounding. Current work extends **discovery/launch surfaces**, schema-bearing contracts, and governed execution paths (including goal-directed live experiments). Prefer extending existing packages over new top-level folders. Domain authority lives in `domain` / `application`; Temporal, Docker, Redis fan-out, and Agents SDK are mechanics, not truth. Vocabulary/specs: prefer `biotech-meta` over inventing names.

Architecture alignment: `docs/workflow-control-plane-current-state-and-next-slices.md`, `../biotech-meta/docs/workflow-catalog-configuration-composition-and-agent-entry.md`.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `app/domain/` | Pure contracts / invariants (no I/O). Packages: `control_plane`, `run_control`, `composition`, `orchestration`, `operation_execution`, `schema_catalog`, `schema_context`, `schema_grounding` |
| `app/application/` | Use-cases, ports, and store adapters. Control plane (`control_plane*`), run control (`run_control*`), linked runs, operation execution/submission, sandbox snapshots, workspace materialization, schema catalog/grounding/context, orchestration, goal-directed live |
| `app/api/` | FastAPI routers: `control_plane` (`/control-plane/v1`), `run_control` (`/run-control/v1`), `schema_grounding` (`/schema-grounding/v1`) |
| `app/models/` | Beanie document shapes: control-plane definitions/ERC, operation bindings/settlements, sandbox snapshots, workspace materialization, artifact promotion, schema grounding records |
| `app/integrations/` | Vendor adapters — Mongo, Postgres, Neo4j, S3, Supabase, Temporal, OpenAI Agents SDK, realtime bus, filesystem workspace, schema agent/Neo4j executors |
| `app/temporal/` | Workflows, activities, workers, and CLI entry scripts (`run_probe`, `run_operation_probe`, `run_goal_directed_live`, …) |
| `app/experiments/` | Diagnostic adapters (e.g. `schema_context_selection`) — **not** imported by production code |
| `app/migrations/` | Application Postgres schema migrations (`0001`–`0004`) |
| `app/middleware/` | ASGI/HTTP middleware (`body_limit`) |
| `app/config.py` | Typed settings / env contract |
| `app/server.py` | FastAPI + Socket.IO ASGI entry |
| `app/preflight.py` | External-system connectivity checks |
| `app/personal_code/` | Reserved local scratch inside `app/` — not product authority |
| `tests/` | Unit + integration tests |
| `infra/` | Compose-adjacent init/scripts (application-postgres, temporal, sandbox) |
| `docs/` | Local diagrams / operator notes — not product authority. Key traces: `CODEBASE_DOMAIN_WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md`, `SCHEMA_GROUNDING_PIPELINE.md`, `workflow-control-plane-current-state-and-next-slices.md` |
| `sandbox-work/` | Disposable live-run artifacts (goal-directed probes, etc.) — not product authority |
| `scripts/` | Operator/dev scripts |
| `.scratch/` | Working issues, handoffs, lifecycle — NOT durable product docs |
| `.scratch/control-plane-foundations-and-capabilities/issues/` | Active control-plane ticket mirrors |
| `../biotech-meta/docs/specs/` | Accepted specifications |
| `../biotech-meta/docs/checkpoints/` | Interview/architecture checkpoints |

## Domain map (what lives where)

| Concern | Domain | Application | API |
|---------|--------|-------------|-----|
| Definition publish/compile/ERC | `domain/control_plane` | `application/control_plane*` | `api/control_plane` |
| Run lifecycle, budgets, commands | `domain/run_control` | `application/run_control*` | `api/run_control` |
| Parent/child links, admission | `domain/composition` | `application/linked_runs` | via run control |
| StageGraph / GoalDirected interpretation | `domain/orchestration` | `application/orchestration`, `goal_directed_live`, `goal_workspace` | — |
| Exact operation bindings, delegation | `domain/operation_execution` | `application/operation_execution*`, `operation_submission` | via run control |
| Snapshot compatibility / restore | — | `application/sandbox_snapshots*` | — |
| Schema catalog/context/grounding | `domain/schema_*` | `application/schema_*`, `supporting_graph_reconciliation` | `api/schema_grounding` |

Temporal workflow names (mechanics): `belllabs.stagegraph`, `belllabs.goal-directed`, `belllabs.linked-run`, `belllabs.operation-execution`, `belllabs.generic-artifact`, plus probe/diagnostic workflows.

## Hard rules

- Do not treat `.scratch/`, `sandbox-work/`, `app/experiments/`, `app/personal_code/`, or local `docs/` as production contracts.
- Put business truth in `app/domain/` and `app/application/`; keep I/O and vendors in `integrations` / `temporal` / `api`.
- Production code must not import `app/experiments/`; promote accepted behavior into `domain` / `application` first.
- When naming or deciding scope, check `biotech-meta` specs/checkpoints before inventing terms or new top-level structure.
- Internal models exist for Workflow Types, Implementations, bindings, and schema grounding; do not add caller-facing catalog/discovery/launch APIs without an accepted spec/ticket. Extend existing `control_plane` / `sandbox_snapshots` packages per `docs/workflow-control-plane-current-state-and-next-slices.md`.
- Create a new `app/domain/*` package only when it owns a distinct lifecycle; query DTOs belong in existing packages.
